// A falsified worry, kept so it stays falsified.  A monomorph is keyed
// `t_7integer_idf`, which is the spelling of a METHOD `idf` on `integer` — so could
// `n.idf()` reach it once a free call has instantiated it?
// Measured 9f5cf6a96, in all three orders (method call after, before, and without the
// free call): `Unknown field integer.idf`.  It must stay refused, and stay ORDER-FREE.
fn idf<T>(x: T) -> T { return x; }
fn main() {
  n = 4;
  a = idf(3);
  b = n.idf();
  print("{a} {b}");
}
